	(text "GPIO map follows ARCHITECTURE.md 9.2: PIO0 bus on GPIO0-15, PIO1 switch chain on GPIO16-20, PIO2 DMD on GPIO21-27.\nGPIO31 reads the coin door memory protect input (J2 pin 10), which the doc does not list yet.\nCore supply from the internal switching regulator: VREG_LX -> L1 -> DVDD (1.1 V), VREG_AVDD through 33 R / 4.7 uF.\nCheck these values against the RP2350 hardware design guide before layout."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 12.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bff876fe-c46b-561e-be78-23a83176cc67")
	)
